==Notes==

===Evolutions===
*When newly acquired from the [[Foundry]], players must acquire '''100''' kills with the Thalys in order to gain access to its Incarnon transformation. The following Evolution tiers, their requirements for unlocking them, and their related perks, are shown below.
**Each challenge additionally grants 5,000 [[affinity]] to the weapon, affected by [[Affinity Booster]]s.

====Evolution I====
*''Unlock Challenge:'' Kill '''100''' enemies with the Thalys.
*Reach '''6x''' Combo and then [[Melee#Heavy%20Attack|Heavy Attack]] to activate Incarnon Form.
**'''+3''' Range.
**'''+40%''' Attack Speed.
**Attacks embed a damaging shard in enemies.
***Light attacks (not slam attacks or heavy attacks) embed a shard in enemies which lasts for 15 seconds. Each enemy can only be embedded with one shard at a time.
***Embedding a shard deals no damage to the main target, but triggers all shards embedded in other enemies, dealing damage to their host. 
****Shards can be triggered regardless of the distance between the newly embedded enemy and any previously embedded enemies.
****Triggering a shard does not remove it from its host and it can still be triggered by new shards.
****Shard trigger damage is '''75% of Thalys's base damage''', for a total of 157.5 Slash Damage and 67.5 Puncture Damage. 
*****If the triggering attack has a damage multiplier from a melee stance combo, it will also multiply the shard damage.
*****'''Is''' affected by base damage bonuses such as {{M|Pressure Point}} and {{A|Vex Armor}}, but not {{M|Condition Overload}}.
*****'''Is not''' affected by IPS, elemental, or faction damage bonuses. Does not trigger forced procs from {{M|Valence Formation}} or {{A|Toxic Lash}}.
*****'''0% status chance''', can be increased with flat bonuses like {{M|Proton Snap}} and {{A|Shroud of Dynar}}.
******Status duration '''is not''' affected by {{M|Lasting Sting}}.
*****'''0% critical chance''', can be increased with flat bonuses like {{Arcane|Arcane Avenger}} and {{A|Wrathful Advance}}.
*****'''1.0x critical multiplier''', affected by mods like {{M|Organ Shatter}} and {{Arcane|Melee Doughty}}.
******{{Arcane|Melee Doughty}}'s bonus scales with Thalys's normal melee stats, not the shard stats, allowing the shards to gain a significant critical multiplier.
*****Cannot trigger {{Arcane|Melee Duplicate}} even when the shards themselves crit.
*Incarnon Form lasts for '''90''' seconds and persists until [[death]].

====Evolution II====
*''Unlock Challenge:'' Kill '''8''' [[Eximus]] enemies with this weapon's Incarnon Transmutation.
*Perk 1: '''Dreadful Reach''':
**On Weapon Status Effect: '''+0.1''' Range for '''8''' seconds. Stacks '''20x'''
*Perk 2: '''Whirling Flurry''':
**+20% [[Attack Speed]] 
*Perk 3: '''Raging Drift''':
**'''+80%''' [[Attack Speed]] while sliding. '''+20%''' Slide 

====Evolution III====
*''Unlock Challenge:'' Perform '''20''' [[Ground Finisher]] attacks.
*Perk 1: '''Nimble Scythe''':
**For each enemy hit by Slide Attack, gain '''+5''' [[Combo Count]]
*Perk 2: '''Echoes of Rage''':
**'''+1''' [[Combo Count]] on Shard Damage
*Perk 3: '''Adept Reflexes''':
**'''+20''' [[Initial Combo]]

====Evolution IV====
*''Unlock Challenge:'' Activate Incarnon Form '''3''' times in a mission.
*Perk 1: '''Swift Transmute''':
**Reach '''3x''' Combo and Heavy Attack to activate Incarnon Form
*Perk 2: '''Vaulting Leap''':
**'''+100%''' Jump and Double Jump Height 
*Perk 3: '''Devastating Mercy''':
**Ground [[Finisher]]s knock enemies down in '''6m''' radius

====Evolution V====
*''Unlock Challenge:'' Complete a Solo mission with an Incarnon Weapon equipped in every slot.
*Perk 1: '''Explosive Growth''':
**Shards grow when a new shard is created, up to '''3''' times. Fully grown shards erupt out of the embedded enemy, dealing '''x2''' damage and impaling them on the spot.
***New shards still trigger existing shards to deal damage, in addition to the growth effect.
***Shard growth is limited to 1 stage per melee swing, regardless of how many new enemies are embedded with a shard. However, a shard '''can''' be embedded and grow by 1 stage in the same melee swing.
***Impaled enemies are stunned for 5 seconds while suspended in the air. After the impale ends, the enemy will fall to ground before taking a second to stand back up.
****Impaling an enemy removes the shard on them. They cannot be embedded with a new shard until the impale is over.
***Impale damage is 2x the normal shard trigger damage, but otherwise has the same stats and is affected by the same mods.
****{{M|Condition Overload}} is an exception, as it affects the impale damage but not the shard damage (likely a bug).
***Impale effect does not trigger {{Arcane|Melee Afflictions}} despite being somewhat similar to {{D|Lifted}}.
*Perk 2: '''Chain Shatter''':
**Heavy attacks (including heavy slams) detonate shards. Shards caught within the blast radius will also detonate.
***Detonated shards deal '''200% of Thalys's base damage''' (420 Slash and 180 Puncture) to their host.
****Has a damaging radius of only about ~'''1m''' with ?% falloff.
****The detonation will also trigger other shards within ~'''5m''' to detonate, which can cause a chain reaction.
****Combo multiplier will only multiply the detonation damage to the shard's host and enemies in the 1m damaging radius. Other shards detonated by the explosion will '''not''' benefit from the combo multiplier.
***'''Is''' affected by base damage bonuses (including {{M|Condition Overload}}), as well as IPS and elemental bonuses (unlike the shard trigger damage).
***'''Is not''' affected by faction damage bonuses.
***Has '''24% status chance''', 0% crit chance, and a 1x critical multiplier.
***Does not trigger forced procs from {{M|Valence Formation}} or {{A|Toxic Lash}}.
***'''Can''' trigger {{Arcane|Melee Influence}}.
***'''Cannot''' trigger {{Arcane|Melee Duplicate}}.
***Enemies that have been detonated are still able to have a new shard embedded in them by further melee attacks, allowing them to be detonated again.
*Perk 3: '''Void Splinters''':
**Shard duration is increased to '''30s'''. Shards become weak spots that have '''+100%''' Critical Chance when damaged. Shard damage is reduced by '''-50%'''.
***Critical Chance bonus is additive to mods such as {{M|Point Strike}}, {{M|Pistol Gambit}} and {{M|True Steel}}.

==Tips==
*Combining {{M|Corrupt Charge}} (or more ideally {{M|Galvanized Reflex}}) and '''Adept Reflexes''' grants a passive minimum 3x [[Melee Combo]], allowing '''Swift Transmute''' to immediately transform Thalys at will.
*When using a ground finisher to embed a new enemy with a shard, the 12x damage multiplier of the finisher will be applied to shard trigger damage on all previously embedded targets.

== Trivia ==
*The name Thalys may be derived from "Thal", an older spelling of German Tal, meaning "valley", and French "Lys", meaning "lily".
*[[Wikipedia:Thalys|Thalys]] is also the name of a European high speed train service.

